            // |   TAB   |   q   |   w  |     e    |     r   |    t   |  PG UP  |            |   rise  |    y   |    u    |   i   |     o    |     p    |    \     |
            // |  CTRL   |   a   |   s  |     d    |     f   |    g   |  PG DW  |            |   lower |    h   |    j    |   k   |     l    |     ;    |   '      |
            // |  SHIFT  |   z   |   x  |     c    |     v   |    b   |   {     |            |    }    |    n   |    m    |   <   |     >    |     ?    |   SHIFT  |
            //                   | LALT |   LGUI   |                                                                      | RALT | RGUI |
            //                                     |    SPC  |  BSPC  |   NUHS  |            |   PGUP  | PG DWN |  ENTER  |
